BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F3 10.5 Tf 15 TL (Dear Diary, today I waked up late becuse my alarm) Tj T* (clock was under my pillow. I dont know how it got) Tj T* (there. Maybe I put it there when I was sleepy, or maybe) Tj T* (my cat Pickle is doing crimes again.) Tj T* ET
