BT 1 0 0 1 0 49.5 Tm /F3 10.5 Tf 15 TL (At school we had a spelling test. I spelled banana with) Tj T* (four n's because the word felt like it needed more. Mrs.) Tj T* (Green stared at it for a long time. I might get one point) Tj T* (for being creative, wich should count alot.) Tj T* ET
